    "name": "lumbar and hip angular displacement vs time",
    "definition": "Lumbar angle = virtual T11-L1 line vs pelvic (ASIS-PSIS) line; hip angle = pelvic line vs thigh line (pelvis relative to femur). Time normalised to 0-100% of the flexion (or return) cycle.",
    "unit": "deg"
  },
  "source": {
    "short": "Pal 2007",
    "authors": "Pal P, Milosavljevic S, Sole G, Johnson G",
    "year": 2007,
    "journal": "Eur Spine J 16(6):741-747",
    "doi": "10.1007/s00586-006-0200-2",
